<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="TIT" style="id">- Doondo</book>
  <para style="h">TITE</para>
  <para style="toc3">Tit</para>
  <para style="toc2">Tite</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mukanda wu Pawuli ku Tito</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mukanda Pawuli wu kasonika ku</para>
  <para style="mt1">Tite</para>
  <para style="imt">Nkotolo</para>
  <para style="ip">Wu ni mukanda Pawuli wu kasonika ku Tite. Tite kaba mu Yudayo ko, kansi wulanda nzila yi Klisto. Wuzyeta na Pawuli nkumbu zizingi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mukanda bewuwu wuyenda bata Tite ku kizanga ki bakwe tumisinanga ti Kelete. Pawuli wusala musisa koko mwanki kasoola bantu mu ba zikuluntu zi minkwikidi. Fweni lonkisa mpe ku minkwikidi bwedi bafweni beela yawu na bahiika, na bwedi kizingu kyawu kifweni beela. Wumuteela dyaka bwedi kafweni haanina malongi ku zimbuta zi bantu, na kuu baala, ku mindongo. Mpe bwedi bufweni beela nkadulu yi zikuluntu zi minkwikidi.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ndandani yi mukanda bewuwu ebu yidi:</para>
  <para style="io1">1) Zimbote na lusambulu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="TIT 1:1-4">1.1-4</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">2) Kuhaana malongi ku zikuluntu zi minkwikidi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="TIT 1:5-16">1.5-16</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">3) Kuhaana malongi ku minkwikidi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="TIT 2:1-3:11">2.1–3.11</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">4) Mbote zimanunu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="TIT 3:12-15">3.12-15</ref></char>)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="TIT 1" />
  <para style="s1">Zimbote</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="TIT 1:1" />Meno ni Pawuli, mundongo wu Nzambi mpe ntumwa yi Yesu-Klisto.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="TIT 1:1">Nzambi wumpaana kiyeko mu nata bantu bebobo ba kasoola baba na kiminu, mpe mu banata ku nzayilu yi kikedika kifwanakani mu ba wukangama mu Nzambi, <verse eid="TIT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="TIT 1:2" />na mu kivuvu ki luzingu lu mimvu ka mimvu. Nzambi yikwe lembolo hunanga, wutuhaana nsilulu yi luzingu lu mimvu ka mimvu, <verse eid="TIT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="TIT 1:3" />mu ntangu yi kakubika, wuzabikisa mambu mandi mu ndongolo yi kampaana mu ntumunu yi Nzambi wudi mvulusi eto.<verse eid="TIT 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="TIT 1:4" />Meno nsonikini mukanda bewuwu ku ngeye, Tito, mwana ani wukedika mu kiminu kii neto ntwadi. Bika Nzambi Tata na Mfumu eto Yesu-Klisto, mvulusi eto, kakusakumuna mpe kakuhaana kiyenge!<verse eid="TIT 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kisalu ki Tito ku Kelete</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="TIT 1:5" />Nakusiisa ku mbanza yi Kelete, mwanki wumanisa mu kubika misamu bemyomyo misala mu hidika, mpe wuzakisa bakuluntu ba dibundu mu kadi mbanza, bonso nsikudukusu zi nakuhaana. <verse eid="TIT 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="TIT 1:6" />Mukuluntu wu dibundu wufweni ba wusungama, na kaba bakala di mukento wumosi kaka. Baala bandi bafweti ba minsambidi, ka babandi na bukolo, mpe na nkadulu yimbi ko yilendi bafundila bantu. <verse eid="TIT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="TIT 1:7" />Mu dyambu ti, mukuluntu wu dibundu fweti ba na nkadulu yimbote, mu dyambu ti yandi ni munkebi wumvwilu yi Nzambi: Kalendi ba muntu wuu na mayama ko, wuu na mankesi ko, ka kinkolo mbungu ko, ka muntu wutiidi bikindu ko, mpe kabandi muntu kwe sosanga mbongo mu nzila zimbi ko. <verse eid="TIT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="TIT 1:8" />Kansi yandi fweti toma zaba mu bwananga banzenza, mpe fweti ba muntu wuzebi mu hidika misamu mimbote. Yandi fweti ba muntu wuu na mabanza mambote, wuludedomo, wuvedila, mpe muntu wukwe kiyaalanga. <verse eid="TIT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="TIT 1:9" />Fweti ba wukangama mu ndongosolo yi mambu ma Nzambi makedika bonso bu baalongila mo. Bwabobo kaabela na ngolo mu syamisa bahiika mu ndongosolo yikedika, mpe mu lonka luvunu ku yobobo bana mubangisa.<verse eid="TIT 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="TIT 1:10" />Mu dyambu ti, kuu na bantu babingi bakwe lembolo tumamanga, mpe bakwe tanga misamu milembolo fwanakana na bakwe hunanga banawu na sungula ha kati di yobobo baa Bayudayo. <verse eid="TIT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="TIT 1:11" />Lufweti bakangisanga minwa, mu dyambu ti bakwe bunganga makanda mamingi mu ndongosolo yi misamu mi luvunu, mpe mu baka mbongo mu nzila zimbi. <verse eid="TIT 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="TIT 1:12" />Wumosi mu mimbikudi mi yawu bende wuta ti: «Bisi-Kelete tuka ntama, bantu ba luvunu badi, bibulu binsisi bidi, na bilenga bimpamba mpe kibazebi kaka ni kudya.» <verse eid="TIT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="TIT 1:13" />Kimbangi bekiki nkatika ki makedika kidi. Ni hahoho, basembila mu kibakala, mwanki baba na kiminu kivedila. <verse eid="TIT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="TIT 1:14" />Ka babandi bakangama mu bimpa bi Bayudayo, mpe mu ntumunu zikwe tukisanga bantu bakwe bisanga kikedika. <verse eid="TIT 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="TIT 1:15" />Bimvimba bivedila bidi ku yobobo badi bavedila, kansi kunaani kima kivedila ku yobobo badi basumuka na balembolo ba na kiminu, mu dyambu ti madyela mawu na mpisulu zawu zisumuka zidi. <verse eid="TIT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="TIT 1:16" />Bakwe tanga ti yawu bazebi Nzambi, kansi bakwe mubisanga mu ndyatulu awu. Badi nkatika bantu bambi, batiidi mu nangumukanga mpe balendanga mu sala kisalu kimbote ko.<verse eid="TIT 1:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="TIT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="TIT 2" />
  <para style="s1">Ndongosolo yi ludedomo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="TIT 2:1" />Kansi Ngeye, longa mambu ma fwanakani mu ndongosolo yikedika. <verse eid="TIT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="TIT 2:2" />Teela binunu bi babakala biba na ludedomo, biba bantu babuzitu na mayindu mambote, mpe biba na kiminu kii nakekete, biba na luzolo mpe na mvibudulu. <verse eid="TIT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="TIT 2:3" />Bumosi mpe ku binunu bi bakento, biba na nkadulu yikwe zitisanga Nzambi. Bibandi na matoola ko, mpe bibandi mindongo mi malamu ko. Kansi bifweti longa ndongosolo yimbote, <verse eid="TIT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="TIT 2:4" />mwanki balonga zindumba: Mu tya babakala bawu na baala bawu, <verse eid="TIT 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="TIT 2:5" />baba na mayindu mambote na mavedila, batomisa nzo zawu, Baba bambote mpe batumimina babakala bawu. Mu bobobo, kunaani muntu waavweza mambu ma Nzambi.<verse eid="TIT 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="TIT 2:6" />Bumosi mpe, syamisa bantwenya baba na mayindu mambote. <verse eid="TIT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="TIT 2:7" />Ngebende mu mimvimba, lonka kifwani mu ndyatulu aku yimbote. Mu ndongosolo aku, ba muntu wusungama mpe wubuzitu. <verse eid="TIT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="TIT 2:8" />Mpova zaku zifweti ba zidedama na zilembolo ba na nsembolo. Mwanki mbeni zaku ziyena nsoni, mpe zilembolo baka mye tuteela.<verse eid="TIT 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="TIT 2:9" />Bika Mindongo mitumimina zimfumu zawu mu mimvimba, babayangidika mpe bababangisandi. <verse eid="TIT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="TIT 2:10" />Babayibangandi kani kima ko. Kansi balonkanga ti yawu bantu bambote badi mpe bakwikama, mwanki bahaana nzitusu ku ndongosolo yi Nzambi, Muvuukisi eto.<verse eid="TIT 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nzambi wuyenikisa mulemvo andi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="TIT 2:11" />Mu dyambu ti, Nzambi wuyenikia mulemvo andi wukwe haananga mpulusu ku bantu bamvimba. <verse eid="TIT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="TIT 2:12" />Wuna tulongisa mu biika mu nata luzingu lumbi na mu biika mpwila zi nza, mwanki mu ntangu beyiyi tunata luzingu lumbote, lu ludedomo mpe lukwikama mu Nzambi. <verse eid="TIT 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="TIT 2:13" />Ni bwabobo twaakingidila kilumbu ki kyese ki tuna siila kivuvu, kyaayenika nkembo wu Nzambi eto yiyinene na Yesu-Klisto Muvuukisi eto. <verse eid="TIT 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="TIT 2:14" />Wukiyekola yandi bende mu dyambu dyeto, mu tukuula mu misamu mimvimba mimbi na tuba bantu bavedila bakavwidi na mu ba na vema mu hidika misamu mimbote.<verse eid="TIT 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="TIT 2:15" />Misamu myamyomyo fweti longa mu lulendo lumvimba mu syamisa bakwe kuyuwanga na mu basemba. Kubikandi nakani muntu kakuyina ko.<verse eid="TIT 2:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="TIT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="TIT 3" />
  <para style="s1">Ndyatulu yi minkwikidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="TIT 3:1" />Babambula moyo ti bafweti tumimina zimfumu na minyadi, batumama, na baba bakubama mu sala bisalu bimvimba bimbote. <verse eid="TIT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="TIT 3:2" />Babiika mu toola nakani muntu, babiika bikindu, baba bantu ba kizunu mpe balonka lembami ku bantu bamvimba. <verse eid="TIT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="TIT 3:3" />Mu dyambu ti, yeto mpe mu ntama tuba bantu balembolo madyela, ba bukolo, bazimbala, mindongo mi zinzinunu na byese bi mumpila mumpila. Twedi zinganga mu nsadulu na mu mpwila zimbi, bedi tubelanga na twedi belasananga yeto na yeto. <verse eid="TIT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="TIT 3:4" />Kansi bumbote bu Nzambi Muvuukisi eto na luzolo lwandi mu bantu bu luyiza zabakana, <verse eid="TIT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="TIT 3:5" />Nzambi wutuvuukisa. Ka mu dyambu di misamu mimbote mi tukwe hidikanga ko, kansi mu dyambu di nkenda andi. Wutuvuukisa mu mbotokolo yi mbutuka yimoona na mu luzingu lumoona lutuhaana Mpeve Yilongo. <verse eid="TIT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="TIT 3:6" />Mpeve Yilongo beyoyo yi kadukula bubwingi mu yeto mu lusadusu lu Yesu-Klisto Muvuukisi eto. <verse eid="TIT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="TIT 3:7" />Mu mulemvo andi, wutusa bantu ba lunungu, mwanki tubyadila fwa bonso budi kivuvu kyeto mu luzingu lu mimvu ka mimvu. <verse eid="TIT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="TIT 3:8" />Mambu bemama makedika madi, ntiidi ti wutoma nyema misamu bemyomyo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="TIT 3:8">Mwanki bamvimba bebobo bakwikidi mu Nzambi batatamana mu sala bisalu bimbote. Bwabobo budi bumbote na mfunu ku bantu. <verse eid="TIT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="TIT 3:9" />Kansi, tina nzonzolo zi buzengi, misamu mi kinkulu, mayuma, mbakani mu dyambu di Misiku. Mu dyambu ti bii mfunu na kisalu ko. <verse eid="TIT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="TIT 3:10" />Tala ti muntu wuna twala nkabani, mukebisa nkumbu yintete, mboki yi nzole. Ku manima, mutatula. <verse eid="TIT 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="TIT 3:11" />Zaba ti muntu wubobo wuzimbala kadi, na kwe holanga masumu, mpe kwe kibedisanga yandi bende.<verse eid="TIT 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nsikudukusu na zimbote zimansukina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="TIT 3:12" />Bu naakutambika Atemase hoti Tisiki, toma sa muswalu mu kwiza mbwana ku mbanza yi Nikopolise, mu dyambu ti kwakoko mbongidi nzengolo mu hyokisila nsungi yi kyozi kingolo. <verse eid="TIT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="TIT 3:13" />Sa manzaki mu bakisa Zenase, wu mulongisi wu Misiku, na Apolose mu nzyetolo awu, mwanki nakani kima kilembolo bakondo. <verse eid="TIT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="TIT 3:14" />Bufwanakani ti bantu bayeto bende balongoka mu sanga misamu mimbote, mu haana lusadusu mu nsatu zivudi mfunu, mwanki baba bantu baabuta mimbutu.<verse eid="TIT 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="TIT 3:15" />Bantu bamvimba baa naani kintwadi, mbote bakutambikidi. Ngeye mpe kokoko ku wudi, haana mbote ku yobobo batutiidi mu kiminu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="TIT 3:15">Bika lusakumunu lu Nzambi luba ku yeno bamvimba!<verse eid="TIT 3:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="TIT 3" />
</usx>